WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.792 --> 00:00:19.179
Eddy was at the racetrack.

2
00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:28.750
Roar! Eddy took off!

3
00:00:28.751 --> 00:00:31.261
There was a bend in the track.

4
00:00:31.262 --> 00:00:33.342
Eddy didn't slow down.

5
00:00:33.343 --> 00:00:35.847
He shot around the bend.

6
00:00:35.848 --> 00:00:39.365
But then he slid.

7
00:00:39.366 --> 00:00:42.332
"Whoa!" cried Eddy.

8
00:00:42.333 --> 00:00:47.840
"I almost crashed!"

9
00:00:47.841 --> 00:00:50.255
There was another bend.

10
00:00:50.256 --> 00:00:54.541
"I'll slow down this time," he thought.

11
00:00:54.542 --> 00:00:57.301
Eddy hit his brakes.

12
00:00:57.302 --> 00:01:04.626
But they didn't work.

13
00:01:04.627 --> 00:01:11.050
Crash!

14
00:01:11.051 --> 00:01:16.943
"Ouch!" cried Eddy.

15
00:01:16.944 --> 00:01:32.844
Eddy rolled slowly to the garage.

16
00:01:32.845 --> 00:01:39.042
Mr. Grill fixed his brakes.

17
00:01:39.043 --> 00:01:44.484
Later Eddy was in the parking lot.

18
00:01:44.485 --> 00:01:50.071
"Let's play tag!" said Poppy.

19
00:01:50.072 --> 00:01:53.004
Eddy roared his engine.

20
00:01:53.005 --> 00:01:57.926
He started to drive.

21
00:01:57.927 --> 00:02:02.758
But then he remembered the crash.

22
00:02:02.759 --> 00:02:10.861
Eddy stopped.

23
00:02:10.862 --> 00:02:15.917
"I'm scared to go fast!"
